<title>UK: London gold fixes firmer, silver rates jump higher.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes firmer, silver rates jump higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $345.75 vs $343.90 previously. Edging higher despite stronger dollar. Some support taken from German revaluation problem. Meeting resistance.</p>
<p>SILVER - Firmer at $4.85/$4.87 up eight cents. Borrowing rates sharply higher on spec interest. Underlying could react.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Barely changed at $409.00/$412.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $2.50 at $187.00/$190.00. Quiet.</p>
</text>
